Attribution required by cited providers
---------------------------------------

Copernicus DEM GLO-30, used as the approximate reference elevation for the site
datum: "Produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 (c) DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and
(c) Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the
European Union and ESA; all rights reserved."

Sentinel-2 L2A imagery, used as the scene the modeled layout was measured
against: "Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2025)."

NASA POWER monthly climatology, used for the environmental values: 2001-2020
climatological means from the POWER project, NASA Langley Research Center.

The authoritative, machine-readable register of every source, its publisher,
its attribution string, its publication date and the date this project last
consulted it is `src/lib/siteData.ts`; `docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md` explains how it
is used. That register is the copy to update — this file summarises it and will
otherwise drift.
